      "text": {
        "en": "Numerous pet owners express gratitude toward veterinarians like Dr Anthony, Dr Tittle, and Dr Neese for their empathetic manner and patient handling during routine exams and end-of-life care. Conversely, several reviewers reported frustrating receptionist interactions, including abrupt telephone manners and unhelpful customer service."
      }
