    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Dependable surgical outcomes alongside diagnosis concerns"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many clients commend the medical team for successful complex surgeries, efficient emergency operations, and thoughtful cancer management for older companions. However, a couple of pet guardians felt that acute symptoms were inadequately investigated or that initial therapies failed to alleviate their animal's digestive distress."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Transparent estimates balanced against costly medications"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "While some reviewers find standard consultation fees transparent and reasonable compared to central Dallas veterinary clinics, multiple clients express frustration regarding substantial markups on prescription drugs and steep total costs for diagnostic testing and emergency care."
      }
    }
  ],
